                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0b08da6-0c71-31d4-9605-ceb2a4e0bf34",
                                        "entry_id": "af9c3ff6-a53d-31c8-997f-05c8920fa2a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characteristic of the cosmos or universe; inconceivably great; vast."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e00bb0e-788a-4c50-8793-9ed621277fe0",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b08da6-0c71-31d4-9605-ceb2a4e0bf34",
                                                "text": "cosmic speed"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "103e9d86-54b5-424a-8601-c609e11cd783",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b08da6-0c71-31d4-9605-ceb2a4e0bf34",
                                                "text": "The human understanding, for example—the faculty which Mr. Spencer has turned so skillfully round upon its own antecedents—is itself a result of the play between organism and environment through cosmic ranges of time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac75c847-bbfa-372e-8e52-5eb71e9409ef",
                                        "entry_id": "af9c3ff6-a53d-31c8-997f-05c8920fa2a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to abstract spiritual or metaphysical ideas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7d38acf-fb5b-4890-aa75-8a17041e505f",
                                                "sense_id": "ac75c847-bbfa-372e-8e52-5eb71e9409ef",
                                                "text": "Humpty Dumpty is the cosmic egg, the wall, the edge between transcendence and existence. As nothing breaks up into the world of things, the movement toward entropy becomes irreversible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "963f337b-f227-4788-855c-67125b315022",
                                                "sense_id": "ac75c847-bbfa-372e-8e52-5eb71e9409ef",
                                                "text": "“It's called transdimentional awareness,” Jay contributed to the conversation, “and it's like totally cosmic man.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a084085-11e2-3ca4-aabc-7a0677861480",
                                        "entry_id": "af9c3ff6-a53d-31c8-997f-05c8920fa2a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rising or setting with the sun; not acronycal."
